          "rank": 1,
          "reason": "Constellation is a primary beneficiary of the 'nuclear renaissance' as tech hyperscalers secure carbon-free baseload power. Recent regulatory wins, including a FERC waiver for capacity rights transfer to the Crane Clean Energy Center (Three Mile Island), accelerate its 2027 restart timeline. Higher full-year EPS guidance ($12.50) and nuclear's scarcity value provide a resilient long-term fundamental floor with technical bullishness.",
